WEBVTT

00:00:00.780 --> 00:00:01.990
Chara-su!

00:00:01.990 --> 00:00:04.020
Is everyone shugo-peppy today?

00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:06.940
It's time to start Shugo Chara Party!

00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:09.240
The next thirty minutes is chock full of shugo-cute anime!

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:11.310
Enjoy it from start to finish!

00:00:11.310 --> 00:00:12.670
Everyone's hearts:

00:00:12.670 --> 00:00:14.190
Unlock!

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:16.450
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:19.960
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:23.760
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:25.630
You may be so sweet girl

00:00:25.630 --> 00:00:27.480
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:29.360
you're like a dream.

00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:31.210
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:31.210 --> 00:00:33.100
You may be so sweet girl

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:34.940
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:34.940 --> 00:00:36.740
it's like I'm dreaming.

00:00:36.740 --> 00:00:40.540
Whenever I start something new

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:44.250
I get really excited,

00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:47.920
though I pretend like it's nothing at all.

00:00:47.920 --> 00:00:51.060
I've always been stubborn like that.

00:00:51.060 --> 00:00:58.700
I think it'd be nice if I could just be honest with myself.

00:00:58.700 --> 00:01:02.490
But it's hard, you know?

00:01:02.490 --> 00:01:06.620
I'll try working on it bit by bit.

00:01:07.230 --> 00:01:11.240
It's party time!

00:01:11.240 --> 00:01:14.990
Someday I'll transform into someone brand new.

00:01:14.990 --> 00:01:18.730
But for now, I want to forget everything else

00:01:18.730 --> 00:01:22.930
and discover all of the potential in me.

00:01:22.930 --> 00:01:26.140
It's party time!

00:01:26.140 --> 00:01:29.850
That brand new me is out there somewhere.

00:01:29.850 --> 00:01:33.360
But for now, I just want to stay as I am

00:01:33.360 --> 00:01:37.990
and find all of the things I can be.

00:01:37.990 --> 00:01:39.780
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:01:47.060 --> 00:01:50.060
Shugo Chara Pucchi Puchi!

00:01:50.060 --> 00:01:52.550
"Ran's Pressure Points?"

00:01:53.700 --> 00:01:55.400
Hey, people!

00:01:55.400 --> 00:01:56.860
Feeling good?!

00:01:56.860 --> 00:01:58.320
Today I'm!

00:01:58.320 --> 00:01:59.340
Feeling good!

00:01:59.630 --> 00:02:00.970
As usual!

00:02:00.970 --> 00:02:02.970
Real good!

00:02:04.690 --> 00:02:06.320
What's the matter?

00:02:06.320 --> 00:02:07.800
You seem down.

00:02:07.800 --> 00:02:09.260
We're fine.

00:02:09.260 --> 00:02:12.260
You are just too hyper, Ran.

00:02:12.260 --> 00:02:14.590
What? That's not true!

00:02:14.590 --> 00:02:16.830
Come on, people, get pumped!

00:02:16.830 --> 00:02:18.640
Hooray for Miki!

00:02:18.640 --> 00:02:20.710
Let's go, Su!

00:02:20.710 --> 00:02:22.270
Whoa!

00:02:25.210 --> 00:02:26.470
What's the matter?

00:02:26.470 --> 00:02:31.530
I'm stuck and I can't move my arm!

00:02:33.600 --> 00:02:35.880
You just overdid it.

00:02:35.880 --> 00:02:37.420
Just slowly relax it.

00:02:37.420 --> 00:02:39.500
Come on, arm, you can do it!

00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:41.670
Hey, stop moving!

00:02:41.670 --> 00:02:46.270
Um, wouldn't it be good to push pressure points at a time like this?

00:02:46.270 --> 00:02:47.590
Pressure points?

00:02:47.590 --> 00:02:50.250
If I press this point, it should instantly release.

00:02:52.130 --> 00:02:54.060
Try moving it slowly.

00:02:55.360 --> 00:02:56.400
Wow!

00:02:56.400 --> 00:02:58.520
She can move it again!

00:02:58.520 --> 00:03:00.070
But...

00:03:00.310 --> 00:03:04.990
I... can... only... move... slowly...

00:03:04.990 --> 00:03:07.400
Oh. What if I press here?

00:03:08.440 --> 00:03:09.610
How do you feel?

00:03:12.490 --> 00:03:14.250
I can't stop!

00:03:14.520 --> 00:03:15.500
Here?

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:18.500
I'm jit-ter-ry.

00:03:18.500 --> 00:03:20.590
This is strange.

00:03:20.590 --> 00:03:21.650
Here?

00:03:21.650 --> 00:03:22.780
Here?

00:03:22.780 --> 00:03:23.830
Here?

00:03:23.830 --> 00:03:24.890
Here?

00:03:26.030 --> 00:03:29.120
In the end, she returned to how she was.

00:03:29.120 --> 00:03:32.210
Maybe it would be best to wait for it to heal naturally.

00:03:32.210 --> 00:03:34.690
But I can't stand waiting around!

00:03:34.690 --> 00:03:36.370
Go, me, go!

00:03:36.370 --> 00:03:38.320
You can do it!

00:03:38.320 --> 00:03:39.190
Okay then!

00:03:39.190 --> 00:03:42.770
In this case, we'll push all her pressure points at once!

00:03:42.770 --> 00:03:44.240
Ready, set...

00:03:49.290 --> 00:03:50.830
Are you better?

00:04:00.170 --> 00:04:02.170
Will she be okay?

00:04:02.170 --> 00:04:04.520
I'm fine!

00:04:04.520 --> 00:04:06.350
Go, me, go!

00:04:06.350 --> 00:04:08.780
Go, Earth, go!

00:04:10.750 --> 00:04:12.890
See you again!

00:04:14.370 --> 00:04:15.890
Shugo Chara Encyclopedia!

00:04:15.890 --> 00:04:17.620
Human Edition!

00:04:17.620 --> 00:04:19.680
First up is...

00:04:19.680 --> 00:04:21.150
Yuiki Yaya!

00:04:22.370 --> 00:04:25.740
She's the Ace's Chair of Seiyo Academy's Guardians!

00:04:26.440 --> 00:04:30.260
Her pigtails and big ribbon are lovely!

00:04:30.260 --> 00:04:35.920
She loves cutes things and sweets, and acts a bit spoiled for a fifth-grader.

00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:50.530
Continuing, the second person is...

00:04:52.140 --> 00:04:53.430
Mashiro Rima!

00:04:54.220 --> 00:04:57.480
Rima is the Guardians' Queen's Chair!

00:04:57.480 --> 00:05:01.990
With her long, cascading locks, she's a real beauty! And she loves comedy!

00:05:03.620 --> 00:05:07.260
She's a sixth-grader in the same class as Amu-chan.

00:05:16.070 --> 00:05:19.120
We'll keep doing these Shugo Chara Encyclopedia introductions each week!

00:05:19.120 --> 00:05:21.230
Look forward to it!

00:05:23.580 --> 00:05:26.720
Shugo, shugo! Egg Battle!

00:05:27.180 --> 00:05:30.390
Today we'll be playing a "touch and answer" character quiz!

00:05:30.390 --> 00:05:33.680
There are a bunch of Shugo Chara figures inside this box.

00:05:33.980 --> 00:05:38.210
Try to pick out the correct Character to solve the quiz, 'kay?

00:05:38.210 --> 00:05:40.000
Okay, here's the question:

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:42.500
Who is Tadase's Guardian Character?

00:05:42.500 --> 00:05:43.920
I know!

00:05:43.920 --> 00:05:45.230
Of course you do!

00:05:45.230 --> 00:05:47.370
Then find him!

00:05:47.370 --> 00:05:48.320
No, this isn't him.

00:05:48.320 --> 00:05:49.770
Nope, not this one.

00:05:50.180 --> 00:05:51.310
Or this one.

00:05:51.310 --> 00:05:52.580
Nope, not him.

00:05:52.880 --> 00:05:54.760
This one's definitely not him.

00:05:54.760 --> 00:05:57.370
It's tough to do just by feel.

00:05:57.370 --> 00:05:59.950
Shugo-fight, girls!

00:06:00.440 --> 00:06:03.390
Oh, Spade, you think you got it?

00:06:05.090 --> 00:06:07.370
Ah, the game's almost over!

00:06:07.370 --> 00:06:10.120
Hurry, hurry, hurry!

00:06:10.120 --> 00:06:12.480
You're running out of time!

00:06:13.790 --> 00:06:16.230
That's it!

00:06:16.230 --> 00:06:18.930
All right, girls, answer together!

00:06:20.450 --> 00:06:23.190
Tadase's Guardian Character is Kiseki!

00:06:23.190 --> 00:06:26.530
Spade and Clover got it right!

00:06:26.530 --> 00:06:27.990
Good for them!

00:06:29.290 --> 00:06:32.790
Today's winners are Amulet Spade and Amulet Clover.

00:06:32.790 --> 00:06:34.520
Do your best next time, too!

00:06:40.170 --> 00:06:42.580
Shugo Chara Pucchi Puchi!

00:06:42.580 --> 00:06:45.490
"A New Guardian Character?"

00:06:47.780 --> 00:06:49.990
Boy, I can't wait to meet her.

00:06:49.990 --> 00:06:53.350
What is this new Guardian Character like?

00:06:53.350 --> 00:06:54.790
Her face is completely white.

00:06:54.790 --> 00:06:56.640
And so is her outfit.

00:06:56.640 --> 00:06:59.440
She also wears a flowing skirt.

00:06:59.440 --> 00:07:01.680
A totally white, flowing skirt, huh?

00:07:01.680 --> 00:07:04.800
But there's this one tiny problem.

00:07:04.800 --> 00:07:08.440
She won't laugh, no matter what we do.

00:07:08.440 --> 00:07:13.210
So we figured we could ask you to give it a shot.

00:07:13.210 --> 00:07:14.950
You can count on me!

00:07:14.950 --> 00:07:17.330
I'll make her laugh, no matter what!

00:07:17.550 --> 00:07:19.410
Ta-da!

00:07:22.240 --> 00:07:23.560
Psych!

00:07:23.560 --> 00:07:25.290
It's just a teruterubouzu.

00:07:23.710 --> 00:07:27.620
Teruterubouzu: A charm hung by children in Japan to ward off rain.

00:07:25.290 --> 00:07:27.620
Sorry to trick you!

00:07:27.620 --> 00:07:29.970
So your name is Teruterubouzu-kun!

00:07:29.970 --> 00:07:31.560
Nice to meet you!

00:07:32.360 --> 00:07:34.540
You've never heard of a teruterubouzu?

00:07:34.540 --> 00:07:36.860
I think she actually believes us!

00:07:36.860 --> 00:07:38.270
Kusukusu, uh...

00:07:38.270 --> 00:07:40.690
Bala-Balance!

00:07:45.870 --> 00:07:47.920
You're right, she really doesn't laugh.

00:07:47.920 --> 00:07:49.310
But we just explained-

00:07:49.310 --> 00:07:50.960
All righty then!

00:08:00.210 --> 00:08:02.050
Kusukusu, listen...

00:08:02.050 --> 00:08:04.850
Just wait, I will make you laugh! I stake my honor on it!

00:08:04.850 --> 00:08:07.670
Kusukusu is on fire!

00:08:07.670 --> 00:08:10.920
Ultra-spin Bala-Balance!

00:08:14.010 --> 00:08:18.090
Hyper-clone Bala-Balance!

00:08:18.090 --> 00:08:21.170
Bala-Balance Rainbow Special!

00:08:21.170 --> 00:08:22.390
Great Super Mira-

00:08:28.070 --> 00:08:29.990
Please forgive us!

00:08:29.990 --> 00:08:31.980
This is all our fault!

00:08:31.980 --> 00:08:33.900
Please listen! We're begging you!

00:08:33.900 --> 00:08:34.910
Don't interrupt me!

00:08:35.260 --> 00:08:37.740
I won't go home until she at least smiles, and that's that!

00:08:37.960 --> 00:08:40.050
But it's not...

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:47.250
The teruterubouzu is laughing!

00:08:47.800 --> 00:08:49.310
Victory is mine.

00:08:50.680 --> 00:08:54.360
Good little children should not play pranks!

00:08:55.620 --> 00:08:58.210
We're sorry!

00:09:03.670 --> 00:09:06.330
See you again!

00:09:06.330 --> 00:09:10.190
Coming up next is Shugo Chara Dokki Doki!

00:09:10.190 --> 00:09:13.400
Today's episode is titled "But why?! Rima-senpai?"

00:09:13.700 --> 00:09:17.110
It's a story about discovering all new charms to Rima-senpai.

00:09:17.110 --> 00:09:19.170
Enjoy!

00:09:19.170 --> 00:09:20.830
After the commercial break!

00:09:33.770 --> 00:09:37.350
What's really important?

00:09:38.610 --> 00:09:43.400
Well, it's white and round and sunny,

00:09:43.400 --> 00:09:50.660
and even if they don't know it, everyone has one in their heart.

00:09:51.940 --> 00:10:02.000
The faith I have in others is what keeps me going.

00:10:02.000 --> 00:10:06.720
Guardian Eggs and X Eggs, Guardian Characters and X Characters...

00:10:06.720 --> 00:10:11.090
They're all precious things.

00:10:11.090 --> 00:10:15.260
And so, Open Heart, go!

00:10:15.260 --> 00:10:16.790
Everything'll be okay.

00:10:16.790 --> 00:10:19.850
Because even if you feel lost,

00:10:19.850 --> 00:10:23.280
you're not alone.

00:10:23.280 --> 00:10:25.440
We'll always be together.

00:10:25.440 --> 00:10:28.080
And when I think of that, somehow,

00:10:28.080 --> 00:10:31.110
I feel warm and fuzzy inside.

00:10:31.110 --> 00:10:34.290
Open Heart, now!

00:10:34.290 --> 00:10:35.950
You can see the eggs, right?

00:10:35.950 --> 00:10:40.960
They're smiling and bouncing around.

00:10:40.960 --> 00:10:46.800
So from now on, forever and ever...

00:10:46.800 --> 00:10:49.020
I'll be counting on you!

00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:56.520
Hurry up, hurry up!

00:10:58.710 --> 00:11:04.510
Hey, wait, stop, what, why?!

00:11:04.510 --> 00:11:07.630
Just come with me!

00:11:12.540 --> 00:11:14.170
There they go...

00:11:12.860 --> 00:11:16.490
But why?! Rima-senpai?"

00:11:14.170 --> 00:11:16.210
Oh well.

00:11:16.210 --> 00:11:18.530
Happens all the time.

00:11:24.160 --> 00:11:26.370
Here!

00:11:29.240 --> 00:11:31.620
What is it?

00:11:31.620 --> 00:11:33.150
That's it over there.

00:11:39.270 --> 00:11:41.710
Look at all the buds that've sprouted!

00:11:41.710 --> 00:11:45.390
It's because of all the seeds we planted before.

00:11:45.660 --> 00:11:47.640
Plants sure are amazing.

00:11:47.640 --> 00:11:51.400
We just planted them a little while ago and they've already sprouted!

00:11:51.400 --> 00:11:53.120
Get bigger!

00:11:53.120 --> 00:11:54.600
Get bigger!

00:11:54.600 --> 00:11:58.190
Get bigger and make pretty flowers!

00:11:58.190 --> 00:12:01.570
Amu-senpai, what type of flowers did we plant again?

00:12:03.020 --> 00:12:06.280
Oh, um, red ones... I think...

00:12:06.280 --> 00:12:08.640
Completely forgotten, haven't you?

00:12:08.640 --> 00:12:12.320
Seriously? Even though we were the ones that planted them?

00:12:12.320 --> 00:12:16.580
And she's supposed to be a role model for Rikka...

00:12:16.580 --> 00:12:18.360
You people are so cruel!

00:12:18.360 --> 00:12:23.270
No matter how much of a scatterbrain Amu-chan is, she would never be so heartless!

00:12:28.850 --> 00:12:31.340
So many buds have sprouted!

00:12:32.220 --> 00:12:34.460
Rima-senpai, what kind of flow-

00:12:34.460 --> 00:12:37.450
There are too many; we need to thin them out.

00:12:37.450 --> 00:12:39.150
Thin them out?

00:12:39.150 --> 00:12:41.940
Pull out the ones that don't look all that healthy.

00:12:46.450 --> 00:12:47.700
No, stop!

00:12:48.870 --> 00:12:49.920
Why?

00:12:49.920 --> 00:12:51.570
It's necessary.

00:12:51.570 --> 00:12:53.370
But, but...

00:12:53.370 --> 00:12:57.320
Maybe I'm not understanding, but can't they all grow into flowers?

00:12:57.320 --> 00:13:01.920
Why would you pull some out? I don't get it!

00:13:05.330 --> 00:13:09.430
If we let them grow like this, the leaves will overlap,

00:13:09.430 --> 00:13:13.680
and they won't be able to absorb the sun's light properly.

00:13:13.680 --> 00:13:17.220
If that happens, the flowers won't bloom.

00:13:17.220 --> 00:13:20.080
Thinning them out helps them all.

00:13:21.590 --> 00:13:24.370
But... But!

00:13:25.360 --> 00:13:30.090
Rikka, listen. I know how you feel, but Rima is-

00:13:30.090 --> 00:13:31.640
You agree with her?!

00:13:33.910 --> 00:13:35.220
Rikka!

00:13:38.940 --> 00:13:41.330
What are we going to do with her?

00:13:41.330 --> 00:13:42.210
Are you sure about this?

00:13:42.210 --> 00:13:43.870
I think she misunderstood.

00:13:43.870 --> 00:13:46.190
It's fine, let's continue.

00:13:54.480 --> 00:13:59.270
Pulling them out just because they aren't needed... How cruel.

00:13:59.590 --> 00:14:02.730
If that happens, the flowers won't bloom.

00:14:04.790 --> 00:14:07.140
That might be true, but still.

00:14:09.990 --> 00:14:13.010
Ah, I just don't get it!

00:14:14.140 --> 00:14:17.960
Athlete Hiiragi Rikka has stuck the Ultra C!

00:14:18.840 --> 00:14:22.210
Wait, now's not the time for that!

00:14:31.270 --> 00:14:34.920
Sheesh. I found another one.

00:14:38.970 --> 00:14:40.150
Oh, I see.

00:14:41.340 --> 00:14:42.830
Come over here.

00:14:45.300 --> 00:14:48.250
It's fine, I said come here.

00:14:50.020 --> 00:14:51.790
Here.

00:14:54.500 --> 00:14:58.820
You're actually someone's heart's egg.

00:14:58.820 --> 00:15:00.090
Did you know?

00:15:01.270 --> 00:15:04.000
You're kind of like a tiny little bud.

00:15:06.510 --> 00:15:09.220
But you put an X mark on yourself.

00:15:11.380 --> 00:15:12.740
A bud, huh?

00:15:13.950 --> 00:15:17.270
Maybe you'll be thinned out, too.

00:15:18.950 --> 00:15:23.190
You're not needed, so for the good of everyone...

00:15:26.900 --> 00:15:28.570
Wait!

00:15:33.120 --> 00:15:33.990
Amu-chan!

00:15:33.990 --> 00:15:35.930
An X Egg's here!

00:15:35.930 --> 00:15:36.870
Rima!

00:15:36.870 --> 00:15:37.450
Right.

00:15:38.160 --> 00:15:39.900
It's coming this way!

00:15:46.660 --> 00:15:47.170
Ran!

00:15:47.170 --> 00:15:48.210
Kusukusu!

00:15:49.340 --> 00:15:51.150
My heart:

00:15:51.150 --> 00:15:52.900
My heart:

00:15:52.900 --> 00:15:54.390
Unlock!

00:16:11.390 --> 00:16:13.830
Character Transformation: Clown Drop!

00:16:17.770 --> 00:16:20.540
Character Transformation: Amulet Heart!

00:16:22.470 --> 00:16:25.460
Juggling Party!

00:16:30.400 --> 00:16:31.880
It stole my juggling clubs!

00:16:35.890 --> 00:16:36.680
Rima!

00:16:36.680 --> 00:16:38.710
Don't worry about me! Get the X Egg!

00:16:38.710 --> 00:16:40.550
Heart Speeders!

00:16:44.900 --> 00:16:46.480
Heart Rod!

00:16:52.350 --> 00:16:53.280
It's a hit!

00:16:53.280 --> 00:16:54.620
Home run!

00:16:54.620 --> 00:16:56.410
Here comes the next one!

00:17:00.330 --> 00:17:01.090
It dropped!

00:17:01.090 --> 00:17:02.250
A sinker!

00:17:05.270 --> 00:17:06.000
Rima!

00:17:07.680 --> 00:17:09.270
Rima-senpai!

00:17:10.640 --> 00:17:13.220
I'm sorry, please calm down!

00:17:15.960 --> 00:17:17.300
Amu-senpai!

00:17:17.600 --> 00:17:23.140
This guy wants to be a baseball player, but he's not good at catching the ball.

00:17:23.140 --> 00:17:25.680
He said he's holding everyone back.

00:17:25.680 --> 00:17:27.770
I see, so that's why the clubs...

00:17:27.770 --> 00:17:28.930
...turned into curve balls.

00:17:28.930 --> 00:17:30.940
He transformed them!

00:17:39.650 --> 00:17:42.530
Rima-senpai, let's escape!

00:17:42.530 --> 00:17:44.710
No, I won't run away.

00:17:45.010 --> 00:17:46.420
Why?

00:17:59.460 --> 00:18:00.640
Could it be...?

00:18:19.020 --> 00:18:20.280
Rikka...

00:18:21.680 --> 00:18:23.040
Rima-senpai...

00:18:33.880 --> 00:18:36.320
The same trick won't work twice!

00:18:38.180 --> 00:18:41.610
If you can't catch the ball now, why not practice until you can?

00:18:45.210 --> 00:18:48.920
You want to enjoy playing baseball with everyone, right?

00:18:48.920 --> 00:18:50.310
You can do it if you try!

00:18:53.970 --> 00:18:56.610
Negative Heart: Lock On!

00:18:58.740 --> 00:19:01.310
Open Heart!

00:19:27.470 --> 00:19:28.730
Rima-senpai!

00:19:32.170 --> 00:19:32.980
Are you okay?

00:19:33.310 --> 00:19:34.720
I'm fine.

00:19:35.840 --> 00:19:41.200
You were protecting those flower pots, weren't you?

00:19:44.920 --> 00:19:49.090
She felt sorry for the buds that were thinned out, so she replanted them there.

00:19:49.090 --> 00:19:51.280
Carefully, one by one.

00:19:51.280 --> 00:19:53.220
She replanted them...

00:19:53.220 --> 00:19:55.520
...with all her heart.

00:19:55.520 --> 00:19:58.230
Even though her hands got filthy!

00:20:00.450 --> 00:20:01.970
Kusukusu!

00:20:03.560 --> 00:20:06.940
Every bud has the potential to become a flower.

00:20:07.510 --> 00:20:09.960
Don't misunderstand Rima, okay?

00:20:09.960 --> 00:20:12.040
She's actually very kind.

00:20:12.880 --> 00:20:14.650
I know that now!

00:20:15.460 --> 00:20:17.580
But she's not honest with herself!

00:20:22.350 --> 00:20:25.870
Rima-senpai, you're super amazing!

00:20:33.050 --> 00:20:35.140
I can't drink tea like this.

00:20:35.140 --> 00:20:37.790
I need to finish this up so I can go wash my hands.

00:20:37.790 --> 00:20:41.150
Rima-senpai, let me help you!

00:20:43.550 --> 00:20:44.940
Fine, get over here.

00:20:44.940 --> 00:20:46.470
Coming!

00:20:52.950 --> 00:20:55.190
It's time for Guardian Egg Fortune-Telling!

00:20:55.190 --> 00:20:58.470
Choose one of the four eggs!

00:21:00.620 --> 00:21:03.280
Which eggs will be the lucky ones?

00:21:07.700 --> 00:21:09.770
Guardian Egg Studying Fortune!

00:21:09.770 --> 00:21:12.000
First, for those who chose Dia:

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:12.920
Four Shugoluck Stars!

00:21:12.920 --> 00:21:14.470
Super Lucky!

00:21:14.470 --> 00:21:19.050
Raise that hand with confidence!

00:21:14.470 --> 00:21:19.350
You might steal the show in class by answering a difficult question!

00:21:20.450 --> 00:21:22.440
Miki's egg gets three Shugoluck Stars.

00:21:22.440 --> 00:21:24.890
Study in your living room at home!

00:21:22.440 --> 00:21:24.890
Your family might help you out!

00:21:24.890 --> 00:21:26.700
Ran's egg gets two Shugoluck Stars!

00:21:26.700 --> 00:21:29.300
Think up a good way of writing!

00:21:26.700 --> 00:21:29.600
You might do better if you change the way you take notes!

00:21:30.400 --> 00:21:32.940
Finally, for those who chose Su's egg:

00:21:32.940 --> 00:21:36.180
Um, you get, um... one Shugoluck Star.

00:21:36.180 --> 00:21:39.910
Being distracted by worries may affect your ability to study.

00:21:39.910 --> 00:21:41.900
Your lucky item is a puzzle!

00:21:41.900 --> 00:21:45.000
Aim to change your state of mind!

00:21:46.640 --> 00:21:48.080
I love Dia!

00:21:48.080 --> 00:21:49.340
I'm gonna do my best!

00:21:49.970 --> 00:21:53.230
Amulet Diamond Audition, Round Two!

00:21:53.230 --> 00:21:54.970
Today they get a chance to wow us with their singing!

00:21:54.970 --> 00:21:56.470
Give it your all, girls!

00:21:56.960 --> 00:22:02.880
Song: "Shugoshugo!"

00:22:00.920 --> 00:22:02.880
She's so good!

00:22:02.880 --> 00:22:13.140
Song: "School Days"

00:22:07.290 --> 00:22:09.430
How mature!

00:22:11.010 --> 00:22:13.140
Maybe she's nervous...

00:22:13.140 --> 00:22:18.810
Song: "Minna no Tamago"

00:22:14.670 --> 00:22:17.720
She's dressed up like Dia! How cute!

00:22:18.810 --> 00:22:25.740
Song: "School Days"

00:22:22.830 --> 00:22:25.200
Nice rhythm!

00:22:26.080 --> 00:22:30.150
They all did their best to show us their characters!

00:22:30.150 --> 00:22:32.370
Next time, we'll finally choose our Diamond!

00:22:32.370 --> 00:22:33.700
Look forward to it!

00:22:36.090 --> 00:22:37.410
They're all so talented!

00:22:37.410 --> 00:22:38.680
Yeah, amazing!

00:22:38.680 --> 00:22:40.850
I'm gonna do my best so I don't lose either!

00:22:40.850 --> 00:22:43.370
See you next week for more Shugo Chara Party!

00:22:43.370 --> 00:22:46.470
Lock On: Open Heart!

00:22:46.800 --> 00:22:48.330
Bye-bye!

00:22:51.640 --> 00:22:58.050
C-L-A-P! C-L-A-P! C-L-A-P!

00:23:13.550 --> 00:23:18.710
Let's put our hands together for you! Yes, you!

00:23:18.710 --> 00:23:22.590
Let's put our hands together! That's what I wanna do!

00:23:25.140 --> 00:23:30.290
Now put your hands together for me! Yes, me!

00:23:30.290 --> 00:23:34.100
Now put your hands together! It's what you should do!

00:23:34.700 --> 00:23:40.080
When I first heard your big dream,

00:23:40.080 --> 00:23:45.480
it was like I was whisked away to another place!

00:23:46.340 --> 00:23:52.690
So, I only know a tiny sliver of the world,

00:23:52.690 --> 00:23:56.780
but at least you're here to talk to me.

00:23:56.780 --> 00:24:02.840
Hey! When I saw that look, that serious attitude...

00:24:02.840 --> 00:24:09.100
Before I knew it, my heart was all aflutter!

00:24:09.100 --> 00:24:10.190
Bravo!

00:24:10.840 --> 00:24:14.650
C-L-A-P! C-L-A-P!
